# Backend env — the documented contract. Copy this to `env/.env` and fill in real
# values. `check:env` validates `env/.env`; `wrangler dev` loads it at runtime via
# `--env-file env/.env`, and deploy uploads the same file as Worker secrets.

# The web app origin. Two jobs: it is the CORS allowlist, and it is the single
# signal src/http/network-policy.ts reads to decide whether this is a dev
# environment — a localhost/LAN value reflects private origins, an https one
# never does. Point it at whichever app calls this API.
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:6161
